### 新增命名模型（管理员）
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/model/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"本地对话模型","kind":"CHAT","baseUrl":"http://localhost:1234/v1","apiKey":"","model":"local-model","timeoutSeconds":60}

### 真实测试连接
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/model/test?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 普通用户选择模型（不返回地址和密钥）
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/model/simple-list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
